<title>JAPAN: Kirin Brewery sets up beer venture in China.</title>
<headline>Kirin Brewery sets up beer venture in China.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kirin Brewery Co Ltd said on Wednesday it has set up a joint venture to produce beer in China.  </p>
<p>A Kirin spokesman said the company will announce details of the venture at 4 p.m. (0700 GMT) in Tokyo.</p>
<p>Kirin has licensed 15 factories in China to produce its beer since May 1995.</p>
